#' Percentile(Direct Method)
#'
#' 
#' @param data .
#' @param X .
#' @param sp .
#' @return A results object containing:
#' \tabular{llllll}{
#'   \code{results$px} \tab \tab \tab \tab \tab a preformatted \cr
#'   \code{results$pt} \tab \tab \tab \tab \tab a table \cr
